      "instance_name": "liberal_privilege_concept",
      "label": "Liberal Privilege Concept",
      "description": "A social and political concept referring to the perceived advantages or protections that individuals may experience due to their alignment with liberal ideologies, often in contrast to conservative or right-wing perspectives. In this meme, it is weaponized to imply that being 'liberal' (and by extension, being Black) granted the subject immunity from legal consequences, which is a false equivalence and a harmful framing.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
