      "description": "The concept that the legal system is not impartial and often operates in ways that disadvantage certain racial, ethnic, or socioeconomic groups. The meme references this concept by implying that liberal privilege (and race) shielded the subject from punishment, which is a cynical commentary on systemic bias, though the framing is harmful and misleading.",
